      "text": "🚨 QUESTION: WHY NOT BUILD IT IN GAZA?\n\nThe U.S. is reportedly planning a $500 million military base near Israel’s Gaza border, able to house up to 10,000 personnel, tied to an international stabilization force for the cease-fire.\n\nWill this base host troops from countries like Pakistan,  Saudi Arabia or Turkey?\nThat would mean foreign soldiers from openly hostile states operating on Israeli soil. \n\nIf the point is to operate in Gaza, then build the base in Gaza. I hear that there are plenty of empty lots in Gaza where a facility could be built. \n\nThoughts?\n\nStay connected, follow, subscribe @MOSSADil.",
